WEBVTT

00:40:57.578 --> 00:41:00.862
that really had very little to do
with the people working there

00:41:00.886 --> 00:41:05.665
and the effort and energy that they put
into building something amazing,

00:41:05.689 --> 00:41:07.112
now affected them all.

00:41:08.099 --> 00:41:09.737
AG: That's such an --

00:41:09.761 --> 00:41:12.692
well I don't want to call it interesting
because it's painful,

00:41:12.716 --> 00:41:15.520
but from a psychological perspective,

00:41:15.544 --> 00:41:18.443
it's a challenging situation.

00:41:18.467 --> 00:41:24.039
Because in a way it feels like
somebody's house just burned down,

00:41:24.063 --> 00:41:26.915
only, number one,
you don't have any insurance

00:41:26.939 --> 00:41:31.002
when it comes to your company
having gone up in flames.